412 0 obj
<<
/Alt (Flowchart of a meta-analysis process: Begins with 1,733 records identified from databases and 6 additional from other sources. After removing duplicates, 1,199 records remain. From these, 1,138 are excluded based on title and abstract, including irrelevant titles/abstracts \(1,131\), non-Chinese/English articles \(3\), and conference abstracts \(4\). From the remaining records, full-text articles are excluded \(44\), including unretrievable articles \(5\), non-police participants \(1\), non-official police physical tests \(4\), and studies using one or several fitness items \(34\). Finally, 19 studies are included in the meta-analysis.)
/ID (ID.0152)
